# Hermes Distributed Management Agent

Hermes is a distributed management framework consisting of a lightweight Zig agent, a Go C2 server, and a C-based plugin system.

## Architecture
- **Agent** (Zig) – Lightweight, cross-compilable, supports TLS, plugins, heartbeat, and stealth.
- **Server** (Go) – Manages agents, tasks, results, and provides a web dashboard.
- **Plugins** (C) – Dynamically loaded shared libraries that execute tasks.

